extends layout

block content
  section.band-tight.page
    p.eyebrow The house
    h1 We own what we offer.
    p.lede Marchmont is not a portal and not an agency. Every building on this site is held on our own account, which is why we can publish the terms in full rather than asking you to call for them.

  section.band-tight.page
    .detail-grid
      .prose
        p A portal earns its money from listings, so it wants as many as possible and cannot afford to be selective about who posts them. That is the mechanism behind almost every property fraud: a listing that costs nothing to create, an agent nobody verified, and a deposit that leaves before anyone notices.
        p We took the other side of that trade. The portfolio is small and turns over slowly. Everything in it is ours. Nobody else can list here, so there is nothing to police, and the only person you will deal with is someone whose name is on this page.
        p That is also why we review registrations. It is not a growth tactic and it does cost us enquiries. It means that when we release an exact address, a floor plan or a title document, we know who we released it to.
        h2 How the money works
        p No payment is possible on this site until we have approved an application in writing. Approval fixes the amount and opens a single window for it. When the window closes, it cannot be reopened, only reissued by us as a fresh decision that is recorded.
        p We take reservation fees on a sale, holding deposits on a lease, and first payments on a corporate let. We do not take a purchase price, we do not hold escrow, and we do not act as your conveyancer.
        h2 What we do not do
        p We give no investment advice. We make no representation about what a building is worth or what it will yield. Where a market requires estate agency registration or anti money laundering checks, we state our position at its actual current stage rather than implying one we do not hold.
      aside.aside
        h2 By appointment
        p Viewings are walked by someone from this office. We will tell you what is wrong with a building as readily as what is right, because you will find out anyway and we would rather you heard it first.
        a.button(href="/register") Register an interest
        a.button.button-quiet(href="/portfolio") View the portfolio
